egin="1:41.087" end="1:41.304">着</span><span begin="1:41.304" end="1:41.850">玻</span><span begin="1:41.850" end="1:42.401">璃</span></p><p begin="1:42.823" end="1:47.269" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.823" end="1:43.324">提醒</span><span begin="1:43.324" end="1:46.864">你 时刻要保护好自</span><span begin="1:46.864" end="1:47.269">己</span></p><p begin="1:47.718" end="1:53.798" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.718" end="1:51.262">忧伤会忘记帆布鞋</span><span begin="1:51.262" end="1:51.777">上</span><span begin="1:51.777" end="1:52.104">的</span><span begin="1:52.104" end="1:53.798">你</span></p></div><div begin="1:56.513" end="2:22.246" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:56.513" end="2:00.003" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.513" end="1:59.258">在梅雨的黑夜</span><span begin="1:59.258" end="2:00.003">里</span></p><p begin="2:00.480" end="2:03.180" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.480" end="2:00.921">在无</span><span begin="2:00.921" end="2:01.207">所</span><span begin="2:01.207" end="2:01.627">谓</span><span begin="2:01.627" end="2:02.074">的方</span><span begin="2:02.074" end="2:02.540">向</span><span begin="2:02.540" end="2:03.180">里</span></p><p begin="2:03.559" end="2:11.047" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.559" end="2:06.283">装满晚风的外</span><span begin="2:06.283" end="2:08.072">衣</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="2:07.036" end="2:09.860">(装满晚风的外</span><span begin="2:09.860" end="2:11.047">衣)</span></span></p><p begin="2:10.416" end="2:15.387" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.416" end="2:10.929">树影</span><span begin="2:10.929" end="2:11.387">拂</span><span begin="2:11.387" end="2:11.988">掠</span><span begin="2:11.988" end="2:14.124">过末班车的</span><span begin="2:14.124" end="2:14.884">眼</span><span begin="2:14.884" end="2:15.387">睛</span></p><p begin="2:15.921" end="2:22.246" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.921" end="2:17.715">孤单的人</span> <span begin="2:17.715" end="2:18.14